---
// THE UNBROKEN SCROLL THREAD.
//
// One fixed canvas behind the entire document, never unmounted, never
// restarted. It is now a 21st.dev "Halftone Dots · LED screen" shader (Paper
// Shaders, Apache-2.0) rather than a hand-written GLSL field — recoloured onto
// this site's blue-black ladder and forced to alpha. See the header of
// ui/halftone-field.tsx for the four deliberate departures from the stock
// component and why each one is load-bearing.
//
// A dead-front display is the right metaphor: most cells sit at --ground and
// are literally invisible, a few resolve toward --hair. Nothing in the field
// ever brightens past the hairline colour, which is what keeps it at 5%.
//
// client:load, not client:visible — this is fixed-position chrome that is on
// screen from the first paint, so deferring it would just stage a visible fade.
// transition:persist keeps the initialised WebGL context across ClientRouter
// swaps; without it the island is replaced by an uninitialised copy on the
// first internal click and the thread goes dark.
import HalftoneField from './ui/halftone-field.tsx';
---

<HalftoneField client:load transition:persist="field" className="field" />
